Source: unbound-os
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: unbound-os
Architecture: all
Depends: unbound-desktop (= ${binary:Version}),
         unbound-greeter (= ${binary:Version}),
         unbound-apt-source,
         greetd,
         network-manager,
         pipewire,
         wireplumber,
         systemd-zram-generator,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Unbound operating system
 Turns a Debian testing installation into Unbound: the Unbound desktop with
 its login window under greetd as the display manager, NetworkManager,
 PipeWire with WirePlumber, compressed swap in memory, and the Unbound APT
 repository, through which the system follows every Unbound release.
 .
 The Unbound desktop does not need this package and installs on any Debian
 testing system on its own.
